// MARK: - FAQ View
"Search help topics" = "Search help topics";
"Getting Started" = "Getting Started";
"How do I record audio?" = "How do I record audio?";
"Tap the + button in the top right corner and select \"Record\". Grant microphone permission when prompted. Tap the red record button to start, and tap stop when finished. Your recording will appear in the library." = "Tap the + button in the top right corner and select \"Record\". Grant microphone permission when prompted. Tap the red record button to start, and tap stop when finished. Your recording will appear in the library.";
"How do I import a video from my Camera Roll?" = "How do I import a video from my Camera Roll?";
"Tap the + button and select \"Import\". Choose \"Photo Library\" to select videos from your Camera Roll. The app will extract the audio track for transcription." = "Tap the + button and select \"Import\". Choose \"Photo Library\" to select videos from your Camera Roll. The app will extract the audio track for transcription.";
"Can I import audio files?" = "Can I import audio files?";
"Yes! Tap the + button, select \"Import\", then \"Files\". You can import MP3, M4A, WAV, and most common audio formats from the Files app, iCloud Drive, or other sources." = "Yes! Tap the + button, select \"Import\", then \"Files\". You can import MP3, M4A, WAV, and most common audio formats from the Files app, iCloud Drive, or other sources.";
"How long does transcription take?" = "How long does transcription take?";
"With the Tiny model, transcription runs about 10x faster than realtime (a 10-minute recording takes ~1 minute). The Small model is more accurate but slower at about 2x realtime. Processing happens entirely on your device." = "With the Tiny model, transcription runs about 10x faster than realtime (a 10-minute recording takes ~1 minute). The Small model is more accurate but slower at about 2x realtime. Processing happens entirely on your device.";
"What languages are supported?" = "What languages are supported?";
"Whisper supports 99 languages including English, Spanish, French, German, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Arabic, and many more. Auto-detect works for most content, or you can manually select a language in Settings for better accuracy." = "Whisper supports 99 languages including English, Spanish, French, German, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Arabic, and many more. Auto-detect works for most content, or you can manually select a language in Settings for better accuracy.";
"How accurate is the transcription?" = "How accurate is the transcription?";
"Accuracy depends on audio quality, background noise, accents, and the model used. The Small model provides the best accuracy. Clear audio with minimal background noise produces the best results. You can edit transcripts after processing." = "Accuracy depends on audio quality, background noise, accents, and the model used. The Small model provides the best accuracy. Clear audio with minimal background noise produces the best results. You can edit transcripts after processing.";
"Does this work offline?" = "Does this work offline?";
"Yes! All transcription happens on your device using Apple's Neural Engine. No internet connection is required, and your audio never leaves your device." = "Yes! All transcription happens on your device using Apple's Neural Engine. No internet connection is required, and your audio never leaves your device.";
"Export & Sharing" = "Export & Sharing";
"What export formats are available?" = "What export formats are available?";
"How do I share a transcript?" = "How do I share a transcript?";
"Open a recording, tap the menu button (...), and select \"Export Transcript\". Choose your format and use the share sheet to send via Messages, Mail, AirDrop, or save to Files." = "Open a recording, tap the menu button (...), and select \"Export Transcript\". Choose your format and use the share sheet to send via Messages, Mail, AirDrop, or save to Files.";
"Storage & Privacy" = "Storage & Privacy";
"How much storage do recordings use?" = "How much storage do recordings use?";
"Audio recordings use about 1 MB per minute. The Whisper models use 75-500 MB depending on which you select. You can delete audio files after transcription to save space while keeping your transcripts." = "Audio recordings use about 1 MB per minute. The Whisper models use 75-500 MB depending on which you select. You can delete audio files after transcription to save space while keeping your transcripts.";
"Is my data private?" = "Is my data private?";
"Absolutely. All processing happens on-device. Your audio and transcripts never leave your iPhone. We don't collect any usage data or analytics. Your recordings are stored only in the app's private container." = "Absolutely. All processing happens on-device. Your audio and transcripts never leave your iPhone. We don't collect any usage data or analytics. Your recordings are stored only in the app's private container.";
"Can I delete the audio but keep the transcript?" = "Can I delete the audio but keep the transcript?";
"Yes! Open a recording, tap the menu (...), and select \"Delete Audio File\". The transcript remains. You can also enable \"Auto-Delete Audio\" in Settings to automatically remove audio after transcription." = "Yes! Open a recording, tap the menu (...), and select \"Delete Audio File\". The transcript remains. You can also enable \"Auto-Delete Audio\" in Settings to automatically remove audio after transcription.";
